Geometry: 50mm diam × 70mm height axisymmetric cylinder (r=0–0.025m, z=0–0.070m)
  Mesh: ms33_cylinder_r25_h70.vtu (this directory's 1066-node / 1000-quad, 1 x 1.75 mm version) + _left/_right/_bottom/_top;
  right face carries NO boundary condition (free). (Mesh name added to the header 2026-09-08, CLAUDE.md 6.7.1.)

Free swelling under constant axial stress = 0.2 MPa (1-D oedometer-like):
  Left  (r=0): u_r = 0  (axis of symmetry)
  Right (r=0.025): u_r FREE  (no radial confinement → free lateral swelling)
  Bottom (z=0): u_z = 0 (fixed base), pressure BC (suction ramp)
  Top   (z=0.07): Neumann (applied axial stress, time-varying)

Loading/unloading path per the CURRENT spec Table Loading_unloading_path (theoretical_benchmarking.tex,
EURAD Overleaf mirror HEAD 6698004 of 2026-09-08, ladder text from commit f626d67 of 2026-07-01: 'Each loading and
unloading step will be applied over a duration of 50 days'; 'A 10-day ramp can be applied during each loading and
unloading stage'). Each stage = 10-d linear ramp from the previous rung, then HELD for the remaining 40 d:
  0        – 17280000 s (0–200 d)   : saturation under 0.2 MPa
  17280000 – 21600000 s (200–250 d) : 0.4 MPa (ramp 200–210 d, hold to 250 d)
  21600000 – 25920000 s (250–300 d) : 1.0 MPa (ramp 250–260 d, hold to 300 d)
  25920000 – 30240000 s (300–350 d) : 2.5 MPa (ramp 300–310 d, hold to 350 d)
  30240000 – 34560000 s (350–400 d) : 5.0 MPa (ramp 350–360 d, hold to 400 d)
  34560000 – 38880000 s (400–450 d) : 2.5 MPa (ramp 400–410 d, hold to 450 d)
  38880000 – 43200000 s (450–500 d) : 1.0 MPa (ramp 450–460 d, hold to 500 d)
  43200000 – 47520000 s (500–550 d) : 0.4 MPa (ramp 500–510 d, hold to 550 d)
  RAMP SENSITIVITY (campaign v2 2026-09-08, runs/VII_550 vs runs/VII_550_r01): the same ladder with 0.1-d ramps was
  run as a sensitivity. End-of-path e_top: 1.1300 (10-d ramps, this deck) vs 1.1293 (0.1-d ramps); MEASURED
